# 🏥 Healthcare Wellness & Preventive Care Portal
### HCLTech Hackathon — Team Implementation Plan

> **Stack:** React + Vite (Frontend) · Node.js + Express (Backend) · MongoDB (Database) · JWT (Auth)
> **Goal:** Deliver an MVP demonstrating security, personalization, and healthcare compliance.

---

## 📁 Project Structure (Agreed Upon by All Members)

```
Healthcare-wellness-/
├── backend/
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── models/         → MongoDB schemas (User, Goal, Reminder, AuditLog)
│   │   ├── routes/         → API endpoints (auth, patients, providers, public)
│   │   ├── middleware/     → JWT guard, role checker, audit logger, error handler
│   │   └── server.js       → Express app entry point
│   ├── .env                → Environment variables (NEVER commit this)
│   ├── .env.example        → Template for env vars (commit this)
│   └── package.json
├── frontend/
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── pages/          → One file per page/screen
│   │   ├── components/     → Shared UI (Navbar, Card, Button, ProgressBar, etc.)
│   │   ├── context/        → AuthContext (global logged-in state)
│   │   ├── api/            → axiosClient.js (auto-attaches JWT headers)
│   │   └── App.jsx         → Routes setup
│   └── package.json
└── .github/
    └── workflows/
        └── ci.yml          → GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline
```

