### Key Files to Create

**`src/context/AuthContext.jsx`** — Global auth state
```js
const login = (token, user) => {
  localStorage.setItem('token', token);
  localStorage.setItem('user', JSON.stringify(user));
  setCurrentUser(user);
};
const logout = () => {
  localStorage.clear();
  setCurrentUser(null);
};
```

**`src/api/axiosClient.js`** — Auto-attach JWT to every request
```js
import axios from 'axios';
const client = axios.create({ baseURL: 'http://localhost:5000/api' });
client.interceptors.request.use(config => {
  const token = localStorage.getItem('token');
  if (token) config.headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`;
  return config;
});
export default client;
```

**`src/components/ProtectedRoute.jsx`** — Guard pages from non-logged-in users
```jsx
// If not logged in → redirect to /login
// If wrong role (e.g. provider trying to access /dashboard) → redirect to /unauthorized
```

### All API Calls You Will Make

| Action | Method | URL |
|--------|--------|-----|
| Register | POST | `/auth/register` |
| Login | POST | `/auth/login` |
| Get patient profile | GET | `/patients/me` |
| Update patient profile | PUT | `/patients/me` |
| Get today's goals | GET | `/patients/goals?date=TODAY` |
| Log a goal | POST | `/patients/goals` |
| Get reminders | GET | `/patients/reminders` |
| Add reminder | POST | `/patients/reminders` |
| Get all patients (provider) | GET | `/provider/patients` |
| Get patient detail (provider) | GET | `/provider/patients/:id` |
| Get public health info | GET | `/public/health-info` |

### Register Page — Required Fields
```
Full Name        → text input
Email            → email input
Password         → min 8 chars, 1 uppercase, 1 number
Confirm Password → must match
Role             → dropdown: "I am a Patient" / "I am a Healthcare Provider"
☐ I consent to data usage as per the privacy policy  ← REQUIRED checkbox
```

### Public Health Info Page — Content
- No login required
- Sections: General Health Tips | Preventive Care Schedule | Privacy Policy | Your Data Rights

### Design Guidelines
- Dark theme: background `#0f1117`, card `#1a1f2e`, accent blue `#4f8ef7`
- Font: Google Fonts `Inter` (400, 500, 600)
- Animated progress bars for goals (fill % based on value/target)
- Reminder/compliance badges: 🟢 Met | 🔴 Missed | 🔵 Upcoming

