## 👤 Member 2 — Backend Core (Auth + Patient APIs + Database Setup)

**Branch:** `feature/backend-core` | **Runs:** `cd backend && npm run dev`

> You own the **foundation** of the backend. Member 3 builds on top of what you set up. Finish the server setup and models first so Member 3 can start their routes.

### Your Responsibilities

#### 1. Project Setup (`backend/`)
- Initialize Node.js project, install all packages:
  `express mongoose bcryptjs jsonwebtoken express-validator helmet cors morgan dotenv express-rate-limit`
- Create [src/server.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/server.js) — Express app with middleware (helmet, cors, morgan, rate limiter)
- Create `.env` and [.env.example](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/.env.example) files
- Connect to MongoDB Atlas

#### 2. All 4 MongoDB Models (`src/models/`)
- [User.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/models/User.js) — patients + providers, bcrypt hash on save
- [Goal.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/models/Goal.js) — daily wellness logs
- [Reminder.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/models/Reminder.js) — preventive care reminders
- [AuditLog.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/models/AuditLog.js) — HIPAA action logging

#### 3. All Middleware (`src/middleware/`)
- [auth.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/routes/auth.js) → [protect()](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/middleware/auth.js#4-35) (verify JWT) + [authorize('role')](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/middleware/auth.js#36-47) (check role)
- [auditLogger.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/middleware/auditLogger.js) → auto-log every sensitive write to `auditlogs` collection
- [errorHandler.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/middleware/errorHandler.js) → consistent `{ error: "message" }` responses

#### 4. Auth Routes ([src/routes/auth.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/routes/auth.js))
| Method | Endpoint | Body | Response |
|--------|----------|------|----------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | `{name, email, password, role, consentGiven}` | `{token, user}` |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | `{email, password}` | `{token, user}` |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | JWT header | `{user}` |

#### 5. Patient Routes ([src/routes/patients.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/routes/patients.js)) — JWT + role=patient
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/patients/me` | Get own profile |
| PUT | `/api/patients/me` | Update profile (allergies, medications, etc.) |
| GET | `/api/patients/goals` | Get goals, filter by `?date=` and `?type=` |
| POST | `/api/patients/goals` | Log a goal (upsert by userId + type + date) |
| GET | `/api/patients/reminders` | All reminders sorted by dueDate |
| POST | `/api/patients/reminders` | Add a reminder |
| PUT | `/api/patients/reminders/:id/status` | Mark as `met` or `missed` |

### Security Checklist (Your Responsibility)

- [ ] Passwords hashed with **bcrypt** (salt rounds = 12)
- [ ] JWT expires in **7 days**
- [ ] Rate limiter on `/api/auth`: max **20 requests / 15 min**
- [ ] Global rate limiter: **100 requests / 15 min**
- [ ] `helmet()` for HTTP security headers
- [ ] Password field `select: false` (never in API response)
- [ ] Input validation on all routes via `express-validator`
- [ ] CORS restricted to `CLIENT_URL` only

### `.env` File — Create This & Share Values with Team
```env
PORT=5000
MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://<user>:<pass>@cluster0.mongodb.net/healthcare_wellness
JWT_SECRET=<minimum_32_character_random_string>
JWT_EXPIRE=7d
CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173
NODE_ENV=development
```

> [!TIP]
> Free MongoDB: [mongodb.com/cloud/atlas](https://www.mongodb.com/cloud/atlas) → Create free M0 cluster → Copy connection string → Whitelist IP `0.0.0.0/0` for dev.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Share `MONGO_URI` and `JWT_SECRET` with Member 3 via chat (NOT via Git). Also share the models folder once done so Member 3 can import them.

