## 🎯 How the Plan Maps to Evaluation Criteria

| Judges Look For | How We Cover It |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| Security & Privacy | bcrypt passwords, JWT auth, rate limiting, HIPAA audit logs |
| Personalization | Profile fields, custom goal targets, health tip, name on dashboard |
| Healthcare data protection | Consent checkbox on register, encrypted passwords, env vars |
| Responsive design | Mobile-first CSS, collapsible sidebar |
| CI/CD pipeline | GitHub Actions runs on every push |
| Role-based access control | JWT middleware checks `patient` vs `provider` on every route |
| Architecture clarity | 3 separate layers: frontend / backend / database |

