All merge to main → CI/CD kicks off
```

### Communication Rules
- **Member 2** shares `.env` values with team via WhatsApp/chat (NOT Git)
- **Member 2** shares exact API response shapes early so M1 can build UI without waiting
- **Member 3** should coordinate with M2 before modifying [server.js](file:///d:/Desktop/healthcare%20project/Healthcare-wellness-/backend/src/server.js)
